      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brewster%2C_Nebraska",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Brewster almost became a railhead when the Chicago, Burlington and Quincy Railroad graded a line from Sargent in 1897.",
